    "MigraineMe is not a medical device and does not diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any condition. This is not medical advice, always consult a qualified healthcare professional." to "MigraineMe는 의료기기가 아니며 어떤 질환도 진단, 치료, 완치, 예방하지 않아요. 의학적 조언이 아니니 꼭 자격을 갖춘 의료 전문가와 상담하세요.",
    "MigraineMe is not a medical device and does not recommend treatments. " to "MigraineMe는 의료기기가 아니며 치료법을 추천하지 않아요. ",
